**RE: Request for a binding ruling under 19 C.F.R. Part 177 — country of origin of Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257**

Dear Director:

Pursuant to 19 C.F.R. §§ 177.1 and 177.2, [FILL IN: requester's legal name] respectfully requests a binding ruling on the country of origin of Kobalt 12.5-amp heat gun, model 5208257, determined under substantial transformation (19 C.F.R. § 134.1(b)), for purposes of country of origin marking (19 U.S.C. § 1304; 19 C.F.R. Part 134) and the application of Section 301 duties. The request concerns prospective importations.

